{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18039","headline":"辛卯年雪 · 韩愈","name":"辛卯年雪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"元和六年春，寒气不肯归。\n河南二月末，雪花一尺围。\n崩腾相排拶，龙凤交横飞。\n波涛何飘扬，天风吹旛旗。\n白帝盛羽卫，鬖髿振裳衣。\n白霓先啓途，从以万玉妃。\n翕翕陵厚载，譁譁弄阴机。\n生平未曾见，何暇议是非。\n或云丰年祥，饱食可庶几。\n善祷吾所慕，谁言寸诚微。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18039.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18039","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}